<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Aganebo Desalonaika</para>
  <para style="rem">1st draft 2014, Advisor check with Yobe, Joseph March 2015</para>
  <para style="rem">VE by Anne Feb 2017</para>
  <para style="rem">Final advisor check with Wabele, Jack, Yobe, Dickson, March 2017</para>
  <para style="rem">CC - remote consultant check by correspondence by Paulus Kieviet in 2019</para>
  <para style="rem">Final team read through with Yobe, Felix and Jack in May 2023, Anne via Zoom from NL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Desalonaika Sesefea Sowi Aganebo Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Desalonaika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Des</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Desalonaika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Desalonaika Sesefea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Aganebo Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Eweguba besabe, sigidubulu idele inolo Desalonaika dauno ami alebaibu ili amohe, wedinale keleba hilisesia, Keliso haiba obegeba saabimo, kegele amene koleba moloyobafebiba hiliselu. Noolohe eweguba solu. “Saminilone hilia amo ama holobagaluba” solu. Ausi, Foloda, Saeleseda, Dimodida, ilihe Desalonaika sigidubulu ine asigi isomesisia, sowi ewe ilifea seleba mebailu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo selesia, hilia amo aso holobagalualeba solu. Maugabalemo, idele inolo elelilu koleba adesia, mana wolu nokene nokeneba kiwigaaba moloba yaeyobafe. Aufia, sulu saidafolo inolo uleno holobagasia, ehe Kelisodai koleba gisa miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe idele inolofea selesia, higinilu noolo holobagagasi, asigi ule ufulufea kiwigaafia melaleba selefe. Idele inolo ine meleba luba miliyone dabalu kiwigaaba molomaleba selefe. Folo ene eda, ene ua dabalu mololoda, ili dabalu molologuba, Desalonaika sigidubulu idele inolo ili amoda, aubasu molomaleba selefe. Ilimo dabalu moloba yaeyomo habosiale, ilihe noolo sagoba ofolaba yaeyone, amoda habomabiyoba solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Foloda</char>, Saeleseda, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodida</char>, ninihe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Sowi ewe, Desalonaika daunone <char style="w">sese</char> alebaibu gili amofea seleba mebaisu. Gilimo, nine Nao Godefeada, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofeada</char>, kulifia alebaibu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:7">Lom 1.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nine Nao Godedai, Saminilo Yesu Kelisodai, gilifea kanuluba ofelesia, gili aeaba melesi moloba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higinilu saabimo, Desalonaika sigidubulu ilimo kiwigaafia kalugaalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, hilia sunia ninihe gili asigisia, Godedai henelu sulu selabasu ado. Nini koleba auba moloyo dobu. Maumo, gine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> sobosia, kolelu alolu. Aufia, gili gine geleba hameselo manamo bulesia, wedinale holobagagaba yaabu. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:4">2Kld 7.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:19">1Des 2.19</ref></char></note>Mau amo alefasia, nini Godene <char style="w">sese</char> labealo sibaisaba ligia, ninihe gine wi digiba sodo. Nini eweguba selaba ado. “Desalonaika ilihe higiniludai, nagadai, sunia diaba ligiaso, ili aso kiwigaafia ligia, asigi ule ufulumo fedoba sefia adoba” sodo.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe sabesiamo, isoba sabelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Higinilu ewe gilifea holobagagafe ogofea alefasia, Godehe ninifea eweguba walefe. Godehe gili osolaba bisigia, gilimo Ene Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone dabalu moloyone ilililu alebaibuba abulu. Dabalu amo moloyone, gili seale ilililu labe. Enebamo, gilihe dabalu amo molofefea alefasia, higinilu diaba ligia, kiwi sanesiale fedoba sefia alebaibu. Aulune, nini hilisesia, Godehe idele inolo osolaba besabemo, E isoba boloba hilisebu.<verse eid="2TH 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:19">Lom 12.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe sabesiamo, isoba sabelo. Ehe inolo gilida higinilu meba yaafe ili amofeamo, higinilu sabe meba obegeyobafe. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:13">1Des 3.13</ref></char></note>Auluso, higiniluda dulu gilifeamo, higinilu amo sabesia, Ehe halemane misiyo meyobafe. Nini uafea auba sabe meyobafe. Saminilo Yesuda, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Ene sulu dia ano</char> kiwigagalu ilida, <char style="w">hebene</char> afasia, ulufa holobagafe fogo amo, Godehe auba sabeyobafe. Yesu inigiamo, E de waiya bule amone usu ami alefasia miyobafe. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:15">Ais 66.15</ref></char></note>Aufia, idele inolo Gode fadaba asigilale ado ili amoda, nine Saminilo Yesune awalu sulu nafuluba kuliba dedalefale ili amoda, Ehe ilifea mana selesia, sabe obegeba meyobafe. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Ais 2.10</ref></char></note>Idele inolo ili amo naga wolu ewegulu diyobafe. Ili amo Saminilodai, Ene kiwigagalu <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelune</char> yane amodaifeamo hago ligia, ili amo woba dafulu alefalu miliyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:4">Kol 3.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia amoyamo Saminilo huga saabi, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> sunia Efea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ili amohe, Ene wi digisia, Efea henesia momoleba babiyobafe. Ausi, ilidai ua heneyobafe maumo, gilida Godene sulu ninihe gili aleba walelu amofea asigi ule ufulu.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Desalonaika ili kiwigaaba homesine Foloda ilihe Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:9">Kol 1.9</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 1:2-3">1Des 1.2-3</ref></char>
    </note>Kegele holobagagaeyobafe amone nini hilisesia, Godehe gili sagoba homesine, ninihe hilia sunia, nine Godedai sulu selaba ado. Nini hamefemo, ewe. Manada Godehe gili molomesi welu amo, mana amogulu moloyone, Godehe gilifea kiwi memesi hamefe. Aufia, ninihe Edai sulu selesiamo, Ehe Ene kiwigagalu alefasia, gili iminifia aafea ami goayone sagoba homesi selesu. Ausi, gili mana nafulu molobaiyesia, mana nafulu moloyobafe. Aufia, Ehe gili gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amone dabalu samodoyone kiwi memesine, nini Edai sulu selesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Auba molosi, gine mana amofea alefasia, gilihe nine Saminilo Yesune wi digisi, Eda gine wi digiyobafe. Nine Godeda, Saminilo Yesu Kelisoda, Aaluhe gili kanulufia, kegele amo gilifea moloba holobagamesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Muguli gelelo inolo misiyo miyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, doma. Agamo, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> saabia obegeba inigia, ninidai wakaliyobafe amone selesu. <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Inolo noolohe Saminilone hiliamo ama holobagaluba selesi dobelesenaga, hidigisia elawanemabiyo. Maumo, sulu amo sealeale. Inolo ili ogo selesia, Gode Ene Ehe ilifea auba saaba ofa soluba selesenagada, me, awalu sulu gi auba dubuluba selesenagada, me, na Folo, ilifea auba saeyone sowi mebailuba selesenagada, hama. Sigiba domabiyo.<verse eid="2TH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 4:1">1Dim 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:18">1Yon 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:3">4.3</ref></char>
    </note>Gilimo inolo ulenohe ene sulu amofea alefasia, me, ene mana amofea alefasia, gili gegemesine fogo mefia waagi melabiyo. Doma. Hilia amo balu holobagaeyobafale. Aubale. Maugaba idele inolo wedinale elelisia, Godefea faiso meba yaeyobafe. Ausi, sulu muguli gelelo inolo amo ulufa holobagaeyobafe. Inolo amo woba damesi iminifia labe. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11.36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ese 28.2</ref></char></note>Inolo amo e Godene <char style="w">sebele molo</char> usu yoba asefasia, “Na Gode loluba” saaba dafelagoyobafe. Aufia, e bamabamaba ene wi digisia, Godeda, kegele sunia idele inolo godegulu gulugululoda, amofea gisa miliyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Na gilidai alolu fogo amohe, sulu kegele ewe gilifea ama saaba melu. Sulu amo gili obegeba asigifela? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6-7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Ais 11.4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">MUU 19.15</ref></char></note>Muguli manada gelelo inolo amo, e aga dabalu moloyo muguba maugafia labe. Auluso, e yasiyone kiwi sunia aso diba anogoluale labe. Maumo, inolo no e kaafia labe. Amo abeba, gili hilisebu. Auluso dufia, eda kaafe amo saabia no kaeyobafale. <verse eid="2TH 2:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ausi, fogo Godehe iminilu amo, muguli manada gelelo inolo ulufa holobagaeyobafe. Ausi, Saminilo Yesu inigia, Ene mofe hoo amohe, e dufa dafelesi, e Yesune misi elalelu bisigia, woba dafiyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:11-13">MUU 13.11-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo sulu muguli manada gelelo holobagaeyobafe amo, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> dabalu mololo labe. Aulune, ehe Sedenefea alefasia, masega mana molosiamo, dabalu kiwigagalu nooloda, masega <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokenebada, moloyobafe. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Ausia, ene masega mana wolu sunia amohe, idele inolo woba dafiyofealomo dedaleba labe ili amone gegeyobafe. Ili gasiba dibaiyoso, ili amo seale mana hameseyomo habolu. Aulugulu, ili amone woba dafiyobafe. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Ausi, Godehe ine asigi dabagalaba ofelesi, ili amo masega sulu amofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyobafe</char>. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ausi, idele inolo sunia seale sulufea asigi ule ufuluale ili amo, wolu moloyosu heheneba moloba ligia, Godehe fadaayo hilia amimo, ili elebe wolu diyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe gili gasiba dafelagoba diyone iminiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 1:3">2Des 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:4">Efe 1.4</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, ne nanodali, ne nelewodali, Saminilohe hamesebu gilimo, doma. Hilia sunia ninihe gili asigisia, Godedai henelu sulu selesenaga, amo nafulu koleba. Maumo, maugaiyafia Godehe gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyone molobebelelu. <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> alefasia, gili galagololu isolu melesi moloba ufulu. Aufia, gilihe seale sulu sodofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. Mana aida amo alefasia, Godehe gili gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulu. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ehe gilida nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone yane <char style="w">elalelu</char> osolaba dimesi hamefe. Aulugulu, awalu sulu nafulu ninihe walelu amofea alefasia, Ehe gili welu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Aulugulu, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, gili kiwigaamale. Aufia, Godene sulu mana ninihe gilifea nine mofe walelumoda, sowi seleba melumoda, amo gili fedoba sefia melale. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisodai, nine Nao Godedai, nini bule koleba hamesebu. Aufia, Ehe nini kanulusia, nine libo kiwigaaba ofolabasu alefalu labe. Ehe nini Efea <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia</char>, henesia yasiba melesi moloba ufia labe. <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />Aufia, Ehe gine libo kiwigaaba ofelesia, mana nafulu suniamo molomesida, sulu nafulu samesida, Ehe gili sagoba ofolo.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Godehe nini sagoba homesine, gili koleba Edai sulu saamale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ne nelewodali, nanodali, afelesiamo, na sulu eweguba selesu. Gilihe nini hilisesia, Godedai sulu saamale. Edai auba sulu selesiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> sulumo alebale hele sunia doba sigimesine saamale. Idele inolo noolo ilida Ene sulu amo, gili dubuluguba, heneba domesine saamale. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Aufia, inolo woluhe, nini woba dafelesia, nine dabalu kaalosine, Godehe ninimo haguba melesine saamale. Gili asigibu, inolo noolo Kelisofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluale</char> alebaibu. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Auluso, Saminilo Ehe moloyo saaba ufulumo, seale mololo. Aulugulu, Ehe gili kiwigaaba ofelesia luba ligia, haguba adesi, <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanehe</char> kegele uleno gilifea moloyobafale. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:16">2Kld 7.16</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:10">Gal 5.10</ref></char></note>Aufia, Saminilo alefasia, mana ninihe gilifea molomalelu amo moloba ligia, dufia gili aubasu moloba miliyobafeba, nini auba hilisebu. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Nini hamefemo ewe. Saminilohe gine asigi ogo luba dibia, Godene hameselo usu faseba malesi hamefe. Ene hameselo usu ami ligia, <char style="w">Keliso</char> E kiwi sanefia afelesiale anoguba, gilida aubasu daabasu miliyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo sunia koleba dabalu molomale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:17">Lom 16.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne nelewodali, nanodali, nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone wi alefasia, nini gilifea kiwigaaba eweguba selesu. Damenedali noolo balu kakainafia ligia, sulu ninihe gilifea saaba melu amo kuliba dedalefale ili amo baaba, gili hago melale. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3.17</ref></char></note>Nine mana kuliba maiyomo, gili asigibu. Nini gili labea alolu fogo amomo, nini balu asuluale. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:9">1Des 2.9</ref></char></note>Nini gilifea naiyo noolo elegebale balu dilale. Aubale. Ninihe elegeba dilo. Ninihe kiwigaaba hogololu dabalu yaidada, nigilibada, molobasu adomo, higinilu gili ulenofea meyalesia moloba ado. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:4">1Kld 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 1:6">1Des 1.6</ref></char></note>Naiyoda, kegeleda, ninihe balu diyone wida aloluso, nini auba duluale. Maumo, gilihe nine mana mololo amogubasu kuliba malesine, ninihe auba gilifea dedeba waleyo hilisefia, naiyoda, kegeleda, balu duluale. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Gili asigibu, nini gili labea ligiamo, ninihe sulu gilifea eweguba solu. “Inolo dabalu moloyo hamesalenaga, amo e naiyo naiyobafale.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 5:13">1Dim 5.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, aga nini dobelesia, gili aleba noolomo balu saabeba solu dubulu. Ili dabalu helegeba molosuba molofale. Aubale. Ili habalo ligia, none kegele anogosu selabasu ado. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">1Des 4.11</ref></char></note>Ausi, agamo, Saminilo Yesu Kelisone wi saabia alefasia, inolo ili ewefea sulu kolelu eweguba selesu. “Gili koleba, helegeba yoba mesale. Gine naiyo kegele amo luba miliyone dabalu molomale.” Balu kakainabu ili amofea sulu auba selesu. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:9">Gal 6.9</ref></char></note>Auluso gilimo, ne nelewodali, ne nanodali, gili koleba, mana nafulu moloyomo bonesia habomabiyo.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Aufia, inolo ulenohe, sulu sunia nini sowi ewe selelu dobu ewemo kuliba aasalenaga, amo gilihe inolo amo nafuluba si bebeleba bafasia, edaimo hago melale. E ene wolu molofe amonemo yuamesine aumale. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:14">1Des 5.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, inolo ogo gine gisaba hilisemabiyo. Aubale. Gili e-mo gelewoba hilisesia, ene asigi isomesisia haguguba sulu saamale.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe afelesia hawiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Aufia, sulu saaba samodosiamo, na eweguba selesu. Saminilo E <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo manane</char> mau ligia, Ehe hilia sunia kegele amenegulu holobagagasi, gili aeaba melesi moloba ufiyobafe. Saminilo E hilia sunia gilidai miliyobafe.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, nene nahe hawiyolu sulu ewe gilifea seleba ofelesu. Gili ewe bamale. Nahe sulu ewegulumo sowi na selefea ami, ne sonehe seleba ofolo. Amo eweguba, sowi na selefe amone eloba babiyone imini ofolo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Folohe sowi selelu amo, ene sone koleba selelale. Aubale. E sulu mofeyo selaba labi, inolo none sone alefasia, sulu e selefe amo selelu. Auluso, aga iwimo, Folo ene sone alefasia, sulu noolo selelu. Ausi, sowi eweda alegafe amohe eweguba eloba bamesine aulu. Sulu sowi ewene usu selelu dobu amo, Folone asigifeafia selelubiyo. Sulu amo inolo none asigifeafia muluba hiliselosine, ehe ene sone imini auba ufulu.</char></note><verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char>, gili suniadai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 3:18">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="3.18" /><verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>